{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-a1b5c702a812","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-a1b5c702a812","name":"鸡蛋花","category":"vegetable_dish","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/vegetable_dish/%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E8%8A%B1/%E9%B8%A1%E8%9B%8B%E8%8A%B1.md","blob_sha":"33db1d0fd8b25563b233817e57bfe38a57fd692c","details":{"introduction":"一道简单易做的家常食疗汤饮，有甜咸两种风味，口感柔滑嫩爽，属于民间润喉小方。富含优质蛋白质和卵磷脂，易于消化吸收，可缓解喉咙干痒不适。制作极简单，初学者看一遍就能上手，从烧水到完成大约只需 5 分钟。","difficulty":"★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 鸡蛋\n- 白糖 （可选，制作甜口）\n- 食盐 （可选，制作咸口）\n- 搅拌器 （可选）"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 1 个人吃。\n\n每份：\n\n- 鸡蛋 1 个 （去壳后约 50 g）\n- 沸水 100 - 150 ml\n- 白糖 5 - 10 g （如制作甜口）\n- 食盐 1 - 2 g （如制作咸口）"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 将鸡蛋打入碗中。\n2. 使用筷子或搅拌器，顺着一个方向搅打蛋液，直至蛋清与蛋黄完全混合均匀，颜色一致。（此过程约需 1 - 2 分钟）\n3. 将糖或盐等调味料加入蛋液中，略微搅匀。\n4. 准备刚烧开的、100 ℃ 的沸水。\n5. **一边用筷子快速搅拌碗中的蛋液，一边将沸水以细流状冲入蛋液中**。确保沸水与蛋液充分混合。\n6. 持续搅拌片刻，直至蛋液被完全烫熟，形成均匀的淡黄色蛋花。"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 为了防止生鸡蛋中可能含有的沙门氏菌，建议使用刚烧开的、100 ℃ 的滚水，瞬间将鸡蛋液完全烫熟。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：净全鸡蛋液150g、饮用水400g、白砂糖15g；整份约500g。选择甜口版本，不加盐，全部汤液食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":54.51,"protein_g":3.78,"carbohydrate_g":3.216,"fat_g":2.853},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","version":"6be582e55a060268","fdc_ids":[171287,173647,169655]},"profile_id":"family-a1b5c702a812-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-a1b5c702a812","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-a1b5c702a812","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-a1b5c702a812-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"water","grams":400},{"key":"sugar","grams":15}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"6be582e55a060268","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-a1b5c702a812-v1.3d797b73342d15f0.json","bytes":17120,"sha256":"3d797b73342d15f0c8a565f5f4d2ddb7672188a224fab98eb1c85d5ca3e37c30"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-a1b5c702a812-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-a1b5c702a812","recipe_blob_sha":"33db1d0fd8b25563b233817e57bfe38a57fd692c","version":"1","data_version":"6be582e55a060268","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":500,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品500g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：净全鸡蛋液150g、饮用水400g、白砂糖15g；整份约500g。选择甜口版本，不加盐，全部汤液食用。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-a1b5c702a812","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"simmer","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":false,"sugar_added":true,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-a1b5c702a812-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"egg","grams":150},{"key":"water","grams":400},{"key":"sugar","grams":15}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_100g":{"energy_kcal":54.51,"protein_g":3.78,"carbohydrate_g":3.216,"fat_g":2.853},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/171287/nutrients","version":"6be582e55a060268","fdc_ids":[171287,173647,16965